## 3. API Design

### 3.1 Session APIs

```
POST   /api/v1/sessions                          → Create a new chat session
GET    /api/v1/sessions?userId={userId}           → List all sessions for a user
DELETE /api/v1/sessions/{sessionId}               → Delete a session
```

### 3.2 Message APIs

```
POST   /api/v1/sessions/{sessionId}/messages      → Send message, get full response (blocking)
POST   /api/v1/sessions/{sessionId}/messages/stream → Send message, get streamed response (SSE)
GET    /api/v1/sessions/{sessionId}/messages       → Get chat history
```

### 3.3 Example: Send Message

```json
// Request
POST /api/v1/sessions/sess_001/messages
{
    "content": "Explain relativity in simple terms"
}

// Response
{
    "messageId": "msg_501",
    "role": "ASSISTANT",
    "content": "Imagine you are standing on a train...",
    "tokensUsed": 128
}
```

### 3.4 Example: Streamed Response (SSE)

```json
// Request
POST /api/v1/sessions/sess_001/messages/stream
{
    "content": "Explain relativity"
}

// Response (Server-Sent Events)
data: {"delta": "Imagine",  "done": false}
data: {"delta": " you",     "done": false}
data: {"delta": " are",     "done": false}
...
data: {"done": true, "messageId": "msg_501", "tokensUsed": 128}
```

