## 4. Core Entities

| Entity | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `Message` | Single communication unit — holds role, content, token count, timestamp |
| `Role` | Enum: `SYSTEM`, `USER`, `ASSISTANT` |
| `ChatSession` | Stateful container for one chat thread — holds session metadata + message history |
| `SessionManager` | Manages all active sessions — creates, retrieves, and evicts sessions |
| `LLMProvider` | Interface — contract that any LLM client must implement |
| `Guardrail` | Interface — contract for input/output validation checks |
| `ContextManager` | Interface — contract for compressing history to fit token limits |
| `ChatService` | **Orchestrator** — coordinates guardrails → context → LLM → response |

