### 7.4 Context Manager — Strategy Pattern

> **Why?** A customer-support bot may use sliding window (keep last 5 messages). An interview-prep bot may use summarization (compress old messages). You swap the strategy without changing `ChatSession`.

```java
public interface ContextManager {
    List<Message> compress(List<Message> history);
}

// STRATEGY A: Keep only the last N tokens worth of messages
public class SlidingWindowContextManager implements ContextManager {
    private final int maxTokens;

    public SlidingWindowContextManager(int maxTokens) {
        this.maxTokens = maxTokens;
    }

    @Override
    public List<Message> compress(List<Message> history) {
        LinkedList<Message> result = new LinkedList<>();
        int totalTokens = 0;

        // Walk from newest → oldest, keep adding until budget is full
        for (int i = history.size() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
            Message msg = history.get(i);
            if (totalTokens + msg.getTokenCount() <= maxTokens) {
                result.addFirst(msg);
                totalTokens += msg.getTokenCount();
            } else {
                break;
            }
        }
        return result;
    }
}

// STRATEGY B: Summarize old messages using a lightweight LLM
public class SummarizingContextManager implements ContextManager {
    private final LLMProvider summarizer;
    private final int recentToKeep = 4; // keep last 4 messages as-is

    public SummarizingContextManager(LLMProvider summarizer) {
        this.summarizer = summarizer;
    }

    @Override
    public List<Message> compress(List<Message> history) {
        if (history.size() <= recentToKeep) return history;

        // Split: old messages (to summarize) + recent messages (to keep)
        List<Message> oldMessages    = history.subList(0, history.size() - recentToKeep);
        List<Message> recentMessages = history.subList(history.size() - recentToKeep, history.size());

        // Ask a cheap LLM to summarize the old messages
        Message summaryRequest = new Message(Role.SYSTEM,
            "Summarize this conversation in 2 sentences: " +
            oldMessages.stream().map(Message::getContent).collect(Collectors.joining(" | "))
        );
        Message summary = summarizer.call(List.of(summaryRequest));

        // Return: [summary as SYSTEM message] + [recent messages]
        List<Message> result = new ArrayList<>();
        result.add(new Message(Role.SYSTEM, "Previous context: " + summary.getContent()));
        result.addAll(recentMessages);
        return result;
    }
}
```

